<section class="get-involved" aria-labelledby="get-involved-heading">
  <h2 id="get-involved-heading">Get involved</h2>
  <p>Three ways to take part — suggest someone, share your own story, or just say hi.</p>
  <div class="get-involved__cards">
    <a class="get-involved__card" href="/suggest-an-artist/">
      <strong>Suggest an artist</strong>
      <span>Know a musician or artist who follows Jesus? Suggest — or vote for — who I should write about, interview, or make a reaction video about.</span>
    </a>
    <a class="get-involved__card" href="/share-your-story/">
      <strong>Share your story</strong>
      <span>Tell me about the music or art you make, and your faith in Jesus. Three questions, and I read every reply.</span>
    </a>
    <a class="get-involved__card" href="#" data-contact-email>
      <strong>Say hi</strong>
      <span>I'd love to hear from you. Write to me — I read every message.</span>
      <span class="get-involved__email" data-contact-email-text>Email me</span>
    </a>
  </div>
  <p>This site is not for people under 18.</p>
</section>
